  "faqCatTickets": "Tickets",
  "faqTicketsQ1": "Where can I buy tickets?",
  "faqTicketsA1": "Go to Tickets in the FUVEKON app, choose a tier, and complete payment as instructed. Each account can only hold one active ticket at a time.",
  "faqTicketsQ2": "What ticket tiers are available?",
  "faqTicketsA2": "The organizing committee publishes tiers (Standard, VIP, etc.) with corresponding benefits in the app. Price and quantity may change each sales wave.",
  "faqTicketsQ3": "How do I pay for tickets?",
  "faqTicketsA3": "After booking, transfer via bank QR or PayPal as instructed, then tap \"I have paid\". The committee will verify and approve your ticket as soon as possible.",
  "faqTicketsQ4": "Are e-tickets valid?",
  "faqTicketsA4": "Yes. Once approved, your check-in QR and digital badge are sent by email and shown in the app. Present the QR at the gate.",
  "faqTicketsQ5": "Can I upgrade my ticket?",
  "faqTicketsA5": "Yes. Approved ticket holders can upgrade by paying the difference. Upgrades also require payment verification before taking effect.",
  "faqTicketsQ6": "Can I get a refund?",
  "faqTicketsA6": "Purchased tickets are non-refundable unless the committee announces otherwise (e.g. event cancellation or major changes).",

  "faqCatRegister": "Registration",
  "faqRegisterQ1": "How do I create an account?",
  "faqRegisterA1": "Choose Register on the sign-in screen, enter email and password, then verify the OTP sent to your email to activate your account.",
  "faqRegisterQ2": "Can I sign in with Google?",
  "faqRegisterA2": "Yes. FUVEKON supports quick sign-in with Google. First-time sign-in may require completing your profile.",
  "faqRegisterQ3": "Why do I need to verify email?",
  "faqRegisterA3": "Email verification protects your account and unlocks profile editing, ticket purchase, and panel/talent/dealer registration after verification.",
  "faqRegisterQ4": "What if I forgot my password?",
  "faqRegisterA4": "Choose Forgot password on the sign-in screen, enter your registered email, and follow the link/OTP to set a new password.",
  "faqRegisterQ5": "I didn't receive the OTP code?",
  "faqRegisterA5": "Check your spam folder. If still missing, use Resend OTP in the app or contact contact@fuvekon.vn.",

  "faqCatDealer": "Dealer",
  "faqDealerQ1": "How do I register a booth?",
  "faqDealerA1": "Go to Dealer in the app, read booth rules, fill out the form, and upload up to 5 price sheets. Your application will be reviewed.",
  "faqDealerQ2": "What are the requirements to become a Dealer?",
  "faqDealerA2": "You need a verified email account and must comply with product and copyright rules. See Dealer in the app for details.",
  "faqDealerQ3": "How much does a booth cost?",
  "faqDealerA3": "Fees depend on booth type, size, and location. The committee sends cost details after approving your application.",
  "faqDealerQ4": "How do I add booth staff?",
  "faqDealerA4": "The booth owner creates an invite code in the app. Staff enter it under Join booth to be added.",
  "faqDealerQ5": "How long until I know the result?",
  "faqDealerA5": "Review usually takes 3–7 business days. You'll be notified by email and in the app when approved or rejected.",

  "faqCatTalent": "Talent Show",
  "faqTalentQ1": "Who can apply to perform?",
  "faqTalentA1": "Artists, cosplayers, singers, dancers, and creators can submit via Talent in the app.",
  "faqTalentQ2": "Do I need an event ticket?",
  "faqTalentA2": "Yes. You need an approved ticket and a verified email account before submitting a talent application.",
  "faqTalentQ3": "What does a talent application need?",
  "faqTalentA3": "Self-introduction, planned performance description, reference photos/videos, and contact info. The full form is in the app.",
  "faqTalentQ4": "What is the application deadline?",
  "faqTalentA4": "Deadlines are announced on the app, website, and official fanpage. Apply early so the committee can schedule performances.",

  "faqCatPanel": "Panel",
  "faqPanelQ1": "What is a panel?",
  "faqPanelA1": "A panel is a themed discussion or Q&A session with guests, speakers, and fans at the event.",
  "faqPanelQ2": "How do I register a panel?",
  "faqPanelA2": "Go to Panel, submit your topic proposal, speaker info, and planned content. The committee will review and schedule if suitable.",
  "faqPanelQ3": "Do I need a ticket to register a panel?",
  "faqPanelA3": "Yes. Applicants need an approved active ticket and verified email, similar to talent registration.",
  "faqPanelQ4": "When is the panel schedule published?",
  "faqPanelA4": "The official schedule is posted under Schedule after applications are reviewed. You can bookmark items for reminders.",

  "faqCatSchedule": "Schedule",
  "faqScheduleQ1": "Where can I view the schedule?",
  "faqScheduleA1": "Schedule in the app shows all activities by day, time slot, and stage/area.",
  "faqScheduleQ2": "Can the schedule change?",
  "faqScheduleA2": "The committee may adjust the schedule for operational reasons. Updates appear in the app and notifications if you bookmarked an item.",
  "faqScheduleQ3": "What is My Schedule?",
  "faqScheduleA3": "Bookmark panels, talent shows, or workshops to view on your personal timeline and get reminders 10–15 minutes ahead.",
  "faqScheduleQ4": "How many days is the event?",
  "faqScheduleA4": "Official dates and venue are announced on the event page and Introduction in the app.",

  "faqCatLostFound": "Lost & Found",
  "faqLostFoundQ1": "I lost something at the event?",
  "faqLostFoundA1": "Visit the Lost & Found desk at the venue or report a loss in the app (description, photo, time, and approximate location).",
  "faqLostFoundQ2": "Where can I see found items?",
  "faqLostFoundA2": "The public Lost & Found board in the app lists recorded items (sensitive identifying details are hidden to prevent fraud).",
  "faqLostFoundQ3": "How do I claim a lost item?",
  "faqLostFoundA3": "Bring ID to the support desk, describe the item and when it was lost. Staff will verify and return it if it matches.",
  "faqLostFoundQ4": "How long until a lost item is processed?",
  "faqLostFoundA4": "Staff update status (Lost / Found / Claimed) in the system. Track progress in the app or contact the desk."
